	(text "SRAM A19 (GPIO47) picks the chip: the lower 512K's /CE is SA19 itself, the upper one's !SA19 (glue sheet).\nA0-A12 and D0-D7 are the console's; A13-A18 the RP's bank lines (GPIO41-46)."
